ly medium noise level rather than a quiet-floor designation.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-individual-quiet-booth-3","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Individual Quiet Booth #3","title":"Close Out Distractions","subtitle":"Single-user sound-isolating booth on Upjohn Library Commons Floor 2","notes":"Book a two-hour block for private study or calls, or use the booth without a booking while staying ready to yield to the reservation holder.","short_summary":"A single-user booth adds sound dampening, a desk, power, and ventilation.","evidence_claim":"Individual Quiet Booth #3 is a sound-isolating single-user room with a seat, sit-or-stand desk, electrical outlets, and a ventilation fan.","source_url":"https://library.kzoo.edu/about/navigating-the-building/floor-2/quiet-booths/","source_title":"Quiet Booths – Library | Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-12-16","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Students may request a two-hour booking through Media Services. Unreserved use is first come, first served, but users must vacate for a reservation holder.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-group-quiet-booths-4-5","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Group Quiet Booths #4 and #5","title":"Keep Group Work Contained","subtitle":"Four-person sound-isolating booths on Upjohn Library Commons Floor 2","notes":"Bring a group of no more than four and reserve a two-hour block when timing matters; the booths sit near study rooms 232–235.","short_summary":"Compact group booths support conversation with less spillover into the library.","evidence_claim":"Group Quiet Booths #4 and #5 are accessible sound-isolating rooms behind the compact shelving, each seating no more than four people.","source_url":"https://library.kzoo.edu/about/navigating-the-building/floor-2/quiet-booths/","source_title":"Quiet Booths – Library | Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-12-16","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Students may request a two-hour booking through Media Services. Otherwise, booths are first come, first served and must be yielded to reservation holders.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-ulc-study-room-211","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"ULC Study Room 211","title":"Claim a Defined Study Room","subtitle":"First-come study room on Upjohn Library Commons Floor 2","notes":"Check room 211 on the north side when you need an enclosed setting, and keep a nearby table or carrel in mind if it is occupied.","short_summary":"A designated second-floor room for focused or shared study.","evidence_claim":"Kalamazoo College lists ULC 211 as a second-floor study room available to students on a first-come, first-served basis during library hours.","source_url":"https://library.kzoo.edu/help-and-services/","source_title":"Library Services – Library | Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-05-06","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Available to Kalamazoo College students first come, first served during library hours; the official page does not provide a reservation option or capacity.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-ulc-viewing-study-room-212","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"ULC Viewing/Study Room 212","title":"Use the Viewing/Study Room","subtitle":"Dual-purpose room on Upjohn Library Commons Floor 2","notes":"Choose room 212 when a viewing-capable setting fits the assignment, and confirm any needed media equipment with library staff before settling in.","short_summary":"A named viewing and study room provides an alternative to open-floor seating.","evidence_claim":"The library identifies ULC 212 as a Viewing/Study Room and lists it among student study rooms available first come, first served during library hours.","source_url":"https://library.kzoo.edu/about/navigating-the-building/floor-2/","source_title":"Floor 2 – Library | Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-12-17","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Available to students first come, first served during library hours. The source does not specify capacity or guarantee particular viewing equipment.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-ulc-study-room-319","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"ULC Study Room 319","title":"Move Up to the Quiet Floor","subtitle":"Study room on the usually-quiet third floor of Upjohn Library Commons","notes":"Try room 319 for an enclosed session on the usually-quiet third floor; nearby window tables provide a fallback if the room is occupied.","short_summary":"An enclosed room pairs with the library’s quieter third-floor environment.","evidence_claim":"ULC 319 is a designated study room on the third floor, which the library describes as usually quiet, and is available to students first come, first served.","source_url":"https://library.kzoo.edu/about/navigating-the-building/floor-3/","source_title":"Floor 3 – Library | Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-12-03","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Available to Kalamazoo College students first come, first served during library hours. The official source does not state capacity or reservability.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
